<![CDATA[<div style=""><div style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Estimado Equipo este Shipment</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;ha sido Confirmado y asignado a Uds. para su posterior&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Entrada al&nbsp;</b><font face="arial"><b>Almacén</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">.</span></font><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Favor de confirmar&nbsp;</b><font face="arial"><b>Recepción</b></font><b style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;de esta Solicitud y continuar con el seguimiento.</b></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">Estatus actual:&nbsp;</font><font color="#006600" face="arial"><b>{!Shipment__c.Shipment_Status_Plann__c}</b></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ff0000"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Shipment:&nbsp;</span>{!Shipment__c.Name}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Cliente:&nbsp;</span>{!Shipment__c.Account_for_Customer_Name__c}</font></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Almacén:&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.Warehouse__c}</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Comentarios:</b>&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Customer_Quote__c.Status_Observations__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; {!Shipment__c.Status_Observations__c}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: medium;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style=""><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div></div>]]></td>
